  "_comment_pmax_term": [
    "Slide 10: raw Performance Max search TERMS from campaign_search_term_view.",
    "That is the only resource returning terms for PMax — search_term_view returns",
    "no PMax rows at all, and the *_search_term_insight resources return category",
    "labels instead of terms.",
    "",
    "Deliberately includes brand terms that MUST be filtered out by BRAND_TERM_RE,",
    "and gives the top brand term more impressions than anything else — so a broken",
    "filter shows up as brand sitting at the top of a slide titled non-brand, which",
    "is the failure that would ship unnoticed.",
    "",
    "Also deliberately: the highest-impression NON-brand term converts at zero. It",
    "must still appear first. Sorting this table by conversion value instead of by",
    "traffic would drop it, and it is the single most useful row on a discovery",
    "slide."
  ],
